    "   \"id\": \"16e31d87-3a87-40c1-aeef-d6ea1171291a\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"Firstly, the IDF must be read using besos's `get_building` function.\"\n",
